Parameters

• builder (IResourceBuilder (https://aspire.dev/reference/api/csharp/aspire.hosting/iresourcebuilder-1.md))
  A resource builder.                                                                                      
• path (string?) optional                                                                                  
  The relative path to test.                                                                               
